  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "事業創新",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO INNOVATIVE ENTREPRENEURSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "事業創新延續創業入門的課程，進行商品/服務模式/經營模式/新技術運用等相關之創新，與商業模式的建立，課程加入創新價值，完成創造力價值鏈的後端價值（從創業到創新, Entrepreneurship to Innovation, E2I）。學生需完成一份創業計畫書（BP），並進行模擬路演，鼓勵參加校內外的創新創業競賽，進行創業知能之整合。",
    "describe_eh": "Business Innovation to continue Entrepreneurship introduction’s courses, progress goods/ service mode/ Business mode/New technique application and related innovations to build up business mode, the course will put in Innovation value, and complete creativity value chain’s back end value( from Entrepreneurship to Innovation). Students have to complete Entrepreneurship Business Plan, and progress simulation roadshow, encourage students to participate the innovation and entrepreneurship competition, and entrepreneurship ability and knowledge to be integrated.",
